# VCS / IDE
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.DS_Store
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# Rust build artifacts
/target
**/target
/bin

# Node / frontend artifacts (backend image does not consume web/)
/web
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.vite
**/npm-debug.log
**/bun.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Local runtime state — never leak into image
/proxy.db
/proxy.db-shm
/proxy.db-wal
/access.log
/proxy.log
/data

# Secrets / env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/charts

# Docker meta (avoid self-copy)
**/Dockerfile*
**/compose.y*ml
**/docker-compose*
**/.dockerignore

# Docs / non-build
LICENSE
README.md
task.md
tests
